WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:09.710
Approve a new phone, give someone a PIN or unlock them, and see every refused or flagged clocking and why.

2
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:16.490
Each person clocks in from one registered phone, so nobody can clock in for someone else.

3
00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:23.060
A new phone waits here: who it is for, which phone, and when they tried.

4
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:29.000
Approve it if they really changed phones. The old phone stops working.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.450
Five wrong PINs lock the account for a while. Unlock frees it at once.

6
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:42.790
To give someone a PIN, open Set the PIN on their row.

7
00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:49.330
Type six digits, or let the office make one. Tell it to them in person.

8
00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:53.480
Close it for now.

9
00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:57.510
Exceptions lists every clocking that was refused or flagged.

10
00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:07.300
Each row says why: outside the circle, a weak signal, an old reading, an unknown phone or a jump no one could make.

11
00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:11.900
Filter by refused or flagged, by person and by dates.
